    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Edward Carey Property is delighted to bring this lovely 3 bed, 1 bath, c93 sq.m semi-detached cottage style property to the market. Located on a small cul-de-sac & within easy reach of all services, this is a wonderful opportunity. The property has a lovely, cosy country feel, with 2 bedrooms & bathroom to the front, the great open plan living room with both an open fire and solid fuel stove which has a back boiler and provides hot water & heating to the radiators, and then the roomy kitchen and 3rd bedroom option to the rear. \n\nOutside the property has a lovely easily maintained front & rear gardens, tarmacaddamed driveway and a useful block-built garage/workshop. \n\nThe location is excellent, a short distance to Cadamstown primary school & GAA, Johnstown Bridge & Enfield villages are fully serviced with a host of services including shops, pharmacy, doctor?s surgery, church, primary & secondary schools, etc. The larger town of Edenderry is within about 15 mins and provides a wider range of supermarkets, secondary schools & so-on. Excellent public transport (rail and bus) to Dublin runs from Enfield, and the M4 Dublin to Galway/Sligo motorway route Junction 9 is also at Enfield. \n\nAre you bidding on one of our properties, new to the market, unsure of the procedure? Check out my website https://www.edcarey.ie/useful-information/ for a helpful guide on buying & selling with us.\n\nTo bid on this property, please go to my website www.edcarey.ie, find the listing & hit the 'Offr' button to bring you to the registration field. I'll then approve your registration and you can bid at your convenience. "
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (3.10m x 2.06m) with laminate wood flooring<br>Living Room (4.93m x 2.94m) with laminate wood flooring, open fireplace & separate solid fuel wood burning stove with back boiler providing dual central heating option<br>Bedroom 1 (3.95m x 3.62m) rear double bedroom with laminate wood flooring & built-in wardrobes<br>Bedroom 2 (3.60m x 2.12m) front single bedroom<br>Bathroom (2.96m x 2.06m) well appointed bathroom, fully tiled with shower, wc & whb, attractive towel-warmer radiator<br>Dining Area (3.17m x 2.97m) <br>Kitchen (4.82m x 4.13m) lovely country style kitchen with great range of fitted kitchen cabinets & appliances included<br>Bedroom 3 (4.12m x 2.92m) rear double bedroom with built-in wardrobes"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Lovely 3 bed, 1 bath semi-detached \nCottage style property. c93 sq.m / 1,001 sq.ft \nLovely site, easily maintained front & rear gardens\nTarmacaddamed driveway\nGreat block-built garage/small workshop\nVery well presented throughout\nLovely open fireplace & solid fuel stove with back boiler \nClose to Cadamstown primary school & GAA\nProperty was built in 1945. well water & septic tank\nDual (OF/SF) central heating. BER F. Potential A\n\n\n"
      },
